    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Andr\u00e9s de Hojeto mocked the D\u00edaz dictatorship as \"General Perfidio\" until police beat him nearly to death; his sire Diego Diego, reminded of his own devoured father, Embraced him instead. The Creation Rites' trauma unhinged Andr\u00e9s' mind entirely, and he re-emerged as General Perfidio D\u00edos, waging a one-Cainite satirical war first on the D\u00edaz regime, then on the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla}, eventually founding the coven that became the Partido Devolucionario Institucional and earning a bishopric.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Perfidio argues (correctly, and to real strategic effect) that @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.6868ee8c357f4b73]{Sabbat} coalitions should fracture a Camarilla city's political and economic stability before ever invading with fangs bared \u2014 but undercuts his own credibility by insisting with equal fervor that the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.OpCOs3PLjmtl0QVu]{Ventrue} Antediluvian wrote NAFTA and that snake-men from the Hollow Earth have infiltrated the PRI.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Diego Diego. Pack/coven: co-leads the PDI with Caridad de Flores as pack priest.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
